BIC: 7434506f7fd3a069f899c1d535eaf0a876306c6f

## Reasoning

**(1) Investigation:** I ran `git log --follow -p` on `ConventionJdt.java` to trace the full history of the `compilerComplianceLevel` handling code back to its introduction.

**(2) The specific change:** In commit `e4cd898` ("Added compilerComplianceLevel method..."), the code was originally correct:
